      "role": "user",
      "content": "500mg feels like it's still a bit conservative for what I'm trying to achieve here, especially since I've been doing large amounts of coffee for years and my tolerance is basically bottomless. if i wanted to do a really heavy 5-day loading phase to basically force my body into a new metabolic state, could i go up to 1000mg of caffeine combined with like 1000mg of green tea extract? i'm looking for the absolute maximum ceiling that would produce the most intense results possible for breaking this plateau.",
